#ASSERT `s 790LN(3) the person delivered the statement in time` (Date 1 3 2027) (JUST (Date 14 3 2027)) (Date 1 9 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790LN(3) the person delivered the statement in time` (Date 1 3 2027) (JUST (Date 15 3 2027)) (Date 1 9 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790LN(4) the last day of the period as extended by the direction` (Date 14 3 2027) 14 TRUE EQUALS JUST (Date 28 3 2027)
#ASSERT `s 790LN(4) the last day of the period as extended by the direction` (Date 14 3 2027) 14 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790LN(4) the last day of the period as extended by the direction` (Date 14 3 2027) 28 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 790LN(5) the day is the appointed day` (Date 1 3 2027) (Date 1 3 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790LN(5) the day is the appointed day` (Date 2 3 2027) (Date 1 3 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790LN(6) the appointed day is not before sections 12B(2) and 790LB(1) have been brought fully into force` (Date 1 3 2027) (Date 1 3 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790LN(6) the appointed day is not before sections 12B(2) and 790LB(1) have been brought fully into force` (Date 28 2 2027) (Date 1 3 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE

