-- (6) relevant officer: (a) a director of a company, (b) one of the members of an entity managed by its members, (c) an officer whose functions correspond to a director's
#ASSERT `s 790LO(6) the individual is a relevant officer` `s 790LO(6)(a) a company` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790LO(6) the individual is a relevant officer` `s 790LO(6)(a) a company` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790LO(6) the individual is a relevant officer` `s 790LO(6)(b) a legal entity the affairs of which are managed by its members` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790LO(6) the individual is a relevant officer` `s 790LO(6)(b) a legal entity the affairs of which are managed by its members` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 790LO(6) the individual is a relevant officer` `s 790LO(6)(c) any other legal entity` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790LO(6) the individual is a relevant officer` `s 790LO(6)(c) any other legal entity` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- ---- s 790LP -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#ASSERT `s 790LP(1) the person must deliver to the registrar the statements required by this section` (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790LP(1) the person must deliver to the registrar the statements required by this section` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 790LP(1) the person must deliver to the registrar the statements required by this section` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
